  {
   "id": "undefeated-121220@major-2026-05-07",
   "gameId": "undefeated-121220",
   "displayName": "\"UNDEFEATED\" Sequel: Release Update & 250K Wishlists!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-07T07:13:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! This is the development team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for your continued support of the \"UNDEFEATED\". It truly means the world to us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today, we have an important update regarding the next chapter of our hero's journey: the sequel, \"UNDEFEATED: Genesis\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Update on the Release Schedule",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today, we have an important update to share. We have made the decision to move the release window of UNDEFEATED: Genesis from 2026 to early 2027.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This was not an easy decision, especially when thinking about everyone in our community who has supported us for so long.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our goal is to create the ultimate superhero experience. We want players to feel the overwhelming power, speed, and freedom that heroes from comics and manga inspire. To achieve that, the combat, superpowers, exploration, and story all need to come together at the highest possible level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After careful consideration, we believe a little more time is needed to bring that experience to PlayStation 5 and PC in the best possible form.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are committed to delivering UNDEFEATED: Genesis in early 2027.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also have something new to share this summer, and we cannot wait to show you more.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "5M DLs for \"UNDEFEATED\" and 250K Wishlists for the Sequel",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "\"UNDEFEATED\": Over 5 Million Total Downloads",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"UNDEFEATED: Genesis\": Over 250K Total Wishlists",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As we announce a change to our release schedule, it is a true honor to be able to celebrate these milestones with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We owe everything to our community.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Key Visual Revealed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Created by illustrator ikuyoan, the new key visual brings together protagonist Albert Hartree (AL) alongside Sia, Sten, and Maya, as they stand against the overwhelming threat of the mutants. The artwork captures the scale, emotion, and high stakes of the original superhero story at the heart of UNDEFEATED: Genesis.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New In-Game Screenshots",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2088020/UNDEFEATED_Genesis/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We appreciate your continued support for the \"UNDEFEATED\" series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
