  {
   "id": "undefeated-121220@major-2024-09-12",
   "gameId": "undefeated-121220",
   "displayName": "New super power is now available - Super Power Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-12T02:03:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! This is the \"UNDEFEATED\" dev team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support of \"UNDEFEATED”. It truly means a lot to all of us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have added the long-awaited super power to celebrate the release of the PS5 version and 2 million downloads.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Super Power",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added new super powers unlocked when hero rank is B or higher.: If you have already met the conditions, you can use it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Events",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added new events that occur when the hero rank is B or higher.: You can transform the newly added superpower into “the long-awaited superpower”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Supports 4K resolution (3840x2160) and WQHD resolution (2560x1440)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some billboards have been redesigned.: The billboards were redesigned during the last major update, and they continue to appear in this update as well. Please try to find them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This year marks the fifth year since UNDEFEATED's release.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UNDEFEATED has also started to be released on PS5 today, and the PC (Steam) version has finally surpassed 2 million downloads. We had no idea that our student project would have such a big impact.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We would like to send our thanks to everyone once again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update is our way of saying thank you to all of our users who have always supported us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please enjoy the new super powers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For more information about the PS5 version of UNDEFEATED, which was released today, and the decision to release the PS5 version of UNDEFEATED: Genesis, please read this article.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue to work hard on development with the aim of releasing 'UNDEFEATED: Genesis' in 2026.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check out the store page and add it to your wishlist.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our goal continues to be to make the most exciting hero experience possible and that will continue in UNDEFEATED: Genesis!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From all of us on the UNDEFEATED team, thank you all for your continued support of 'UNDEFEATED'.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
