  {
   "id": "undefeated-121220@major-2024-02-20",
   "gameId": "undefeated-121220",
   "displayName": "Major Update Available!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-02-20T01:00:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! This is the \"UNDEFEATED\" dev team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support of \"UNDEFEATED”. It truly means a lot to all of us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are excited to let everyone know that we have fixed the major issue which led to the game crashing for many players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also made other small fixes and changes so please check them out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Crash Bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that caused the game to crash on startup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the game would crash after a certain amount of time from the start of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have done our best to fix these issues. However, these fixes may still not make the game playable for everyone, but we believe it is now playable for more people than ever before. Thank you for your patience and understanding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Language support",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The language setting is now set to \"English\" when the game is launched for the first time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The display may sometimes still show a mixture of Japanese and English. If you encounter this issue, please try changing language and back again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the normal number of gangs was not generated and quests did not progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the amount of damage dealt to bosses based on the player’s hero rank.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem where citizens would remain in a \"running away\" state.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some billboards have been redesigned.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Easter Eggs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have added a very small number of Easter Eggs…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, thank you for supporting UNDEFEATED for the past four years.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are now working hard to release UNDEFEATED: Genesis in 2026.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check out our store page and add it to your wishlist. It helps us a huge amount!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our goal continues to be to make the most exciting hero experience possible and that will continue in UNDEFEATED: Genesis!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From all of us on the UNDEFEATED team, thank you all for your continued support of \"UNDEFEATED\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
