  {
   "id": "undefeated-121220@major-2024-01-24",
   "gameId": "undefeated-121220",
   "displayName": "[UPDATE] Game crashing issues",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-24T10:16:17.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! This is Yuma and Daigo from the \"UNDEFEATED\" dev team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We first released this game four years ago in August 2019. Since then, there have been over 1.95m downloads! We never expected so many people to play our free student project and we’re extremely grateful to everyone that has.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This post is to let everyone know that we have seen the reviews about the game crashing and we are currently working on a fix. We expect to finish development on the patch by the end of February.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once released, we cannot guarantee that the fix will work for everyone and would appreciate your understanding in this regard.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As soon as we are ready to release the patch, we will post an update here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our small team is currently focused on the development of the sequel to this game, UNDEFEATED: Genesis.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once we have finished and launched the patch for \"UNDEFEATED\", we will get back to making \"UNDEFEATED: Genesis\" the best game we can.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check out the store page and add to your wish list - it helps us a lot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yuma and Daigo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
